    <!-- Your data: the privacy statement ("Tetto sends nothing", and what Android's backup does:
         CLAUDE.md), then the backup, the restore, the spends for a spreadsheet, erasing everything. -->
    <string name="settings_group_data">Your data</string>
    <string name="settings_privacy_headline">No account, no ads, no tracking.</string>
    <string name="settings_privacy_body">Tetto has no internet permission at all, so it cannot send your caps or your spends anywhere: Tetto sends nothing. They stay on this phone, and leave it only in a file you save yourself, or in Android’s own backup, if you turned it on, which keeps a copy of them and of your settings in your Google account, encrypted with your screen lock.</string>

